  shortDescription: A scorched and torn letter bearing a threatening ultimatum.
  detailedInspectionText: "Scorched scrap of hotel stationery found upon the writing bureau:\n\n'Madame Valerie,\nYour silence cannot be bought twice. Tonight at midnight, your secrets die with you. Meridian House will keep its peace.'\n\nSigned only with a solitary initial: '\u2014 P.'"
